<p>In our core analyses, we consider tiers 1 and 2 to be ‘confirmed files’ (for a total of 5,855), while we treat tier 3 and non-decodable singletons as uncategorized.</p>
<p>We labeled each file row with the total number of chunks in the file<sup id="fnref:127"><a href="#fn:127" class="footnote" rel="footnote">127</a></sup> (so that we could re-weight by 1/(file chunks) to estimate the rate of whole files sent).</p>
